  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed roof extension to facilitate a third storey of residential accommodation with part pitched and part flat roof, by reason of its scale, massing and design detail, would result in an overly dominant addition to this subsidiary 'rear projection' element, unbalancing the relationship with the main frontage of the building and introducing an awkward roof, together with a style of fenestrations that would relate poorly to the existing architecture within the setting, detrimental to the character and appearance of the Winchmore Hill Green Conservation Area, contrary to policies DMD8, DMD13, DMD37 and DMD44 of the Development Management Document, CP30 and CP31 of the Core Strategy, D3 and HC1 of the London Plan (2021) as well as the aims and intentions outlined within the Winchmore Hill Conservation Area Character Appraisal and Management Proposals and the NPPF (2023)."
